1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 29=

5
00:00:11,279 --> 00:00:12,880
Now that we've gone public,

6
00:00:13,439 --> 00:00:14,880
do you feel relieved?

7
00:00:16,239 --> 00:00:16,760
A little.

8
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:19,879
Just a little?

9
00:00:21,559 --> 00:00:23,480
I'm mostly happy.

10
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:26,199
Because

11
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:29,000
I'm not keeping you a secret anymore?

12
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:32,359
Because

13
00:00:34,799 --> 00:00:36,479
you're finally letting yourself be seen.

14
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,359
Xie Zhouhan,

15
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:44,280
I want to hear

16
00:00:44,759 --> 00:00:45,799
your whole story.

17
00:00:47,159 --> 00:00:47,679
Can I?

18
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:55,840
When I was little,

19
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:58,880
I was sent to Honghe Town.

20
00:01:00,439 --> 00:01:01,159
Mrs. Su

21
00:01:02,079 --> 00:01:03,640
was the only person who was kind to me.

22
00:01:04,799 --> 00:01:05,840
Back then, I felt like

23
00:01:06,359 --> 00:01:07,400
I didn't matter

24
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:08,519
to anyone.

25
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,319
No one cared if I was cold

26
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:12,400
or hungry.

27
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,000
But Mrs. Su

28
00:01:18,439 --> 00:01:19,680
would make me hot soup,

29
00:01:20,599 --> 00:01:22,079
sit with me in the yard and talk,

30
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:23,840
and remind me

31
00:01:26,159 --> 00:01:27,519
I wasn't an unwanted child.

32
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,400
Then you came along.

33
00:01:35,159 --> 00:01:36,560
The first time I held you,

34
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:39,159
you cried your little heart out.

35
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,200
But I felt like

36
00:01:43,319 --> 00:01:44,200
my world

37
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:47,040
suddenly had

38
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:49,799
something to look forward to.

39
00:01:55,239 --> 00:01:56,200
So,

40
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,480
you kept looking for me after that?

41
00:01:59,439 --> 00:01:59,840
Yes.

42
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,280
After I got back from Africa,

43
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:05,120
the Lins had hit hard times.

44
00:02:06,799 --> 00:02:08,120
I found out the Gus had adopted you.

45
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:09,639
But

46
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:12,680
I didn't dare just show up

47
00:02:13,879 --> 00:02:15,080
and disrupt your life.

48
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:16,919
Then, three years ago,

49
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,080
you and Bao'er became friends.

50
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:21,919
At first,

51
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,520
I really just wanted to make sure

52
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:24,479
you were doing okay.

53
00:02:26,199 --> 00:02:27,199
But later, I realized

54
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:30,560
I'd loved you all along.

55
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:33,840
I love you,

56
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,960
not because you're Mrs. Su's daughter,

57
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,039
but because of who you are.

58
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,919
Because you're the one

59
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,800
who protected Bao'er from harm.

60
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,800
The one who's been hurt,

61
00:02:47,719 --> 00:02:49,800
but still chooses to trust people.

62
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:53,840
I've always known

63
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:58,199
you're the one I want to grow old with.

64
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:11,719
Xie Zhouhan,

65
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:15,319
would you

66
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,759
start over with me?

67
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:22,400
No contract.

68
00:03:23,479 --> 00:03:24,439
No debt to repay.

69
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,159
Just Lin Hua,

70
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,960
wanting to be with Xie Zhouhan.

71
00:03:43,670 --> 00:03:46,580
♪I truly want to love you♪

72
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:50,020
♪From dawn until dusk♪

73
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:52,120
♪I want to tell you about every dinner♪

74
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,639
This is so sudden.

75
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,439
I've been ready for a long time.

76
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:59,479
Now let me ask you again.

77
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,159
Will you marry me?

78
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:03,960
♪My life from now on is in your hands♪

79
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:06,080
Aren't we already married?

80
00:04:07,439 --> 00:04:08,680
That was a contract marriage.

81
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,319
This time,

82
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:11,680
it's real.

83
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,719
Then ask me again.

84
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,040
Lin Hua,

85
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,160
will you marry me?

86
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:26,940
♪Telling you, one by one♪

87
00:04:26,941 --> 00:04:29,720
♪I truly want to marry you♪

88
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,560
Yes, I do.

89
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:33,940
♪My life from now on is in your hands♪

90
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:37,940
♪Together from today till we turn gray♪

91
00:04:37,940 --> 00:04:39,820
♪Will you♪

92
00:04:39,820 --> 00:04:43,460
♪Walk this road with me?♪

93
00:04:44,380 --> 00:04:47,460
♪If the crowd gets too thick♪

94
00:04:47,460 --> 00:04:51,060
♪I'll hold you tight♪

95
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:53,660
♪If storms lie ahead♪

96
00:04:53,660 --> 00:04:55,660
♪I'll face the rain with you♪

97
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:58,183
=You Alone Know Me=
(Two Hearts, One Lifetime)

98
00:04:58,183 --> 00:05:01,100
♪I truly love you♪

99
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:04,820
♪I want my name to be part of your life♪

100
