♪I truly want to marry you♪

104
00:05:14,820 --> 00:05:16,609
♪I'll spend my life proving♪

105
00:05:16,609 --> 00:05:18,100
♪This promise♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

106
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:22,460
♪I'll love you from now till we're old♪

107
